\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces Total time per reference versus miss cost for CLOCK, S3-FIFO, ContShadow and DA, with the lower envelope of the three comparators (black dashed). CLOCK is cheapest below 0.216\,\textmu s, S3-FIFO between 0.216 and 2.305\,\textmu s, and ContShadow above 2.305\,\textmu s; DA is never on the envelope, with a minimum excess of 3.27\,ns/reference at 2.305\,\textmu s. The orange band is the measured minor-fault cost. The inset zooms the CLOCK/S3-FIFO crossing.}}{10}{figure.caption.22}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:breakeven}{{6}{10}{Total time per reference versus miss cost for CLOCK, S3-FIFO, ContShadow and DA, with the lower envelope of the three comparators (black dashed). CLOCK is cheapest below 0.216\us , S3-FIFO between 0.216 and 2.305\us , and ContShadow above 2.305\us ; DA is never on the envelope, with a minimum excess of 3.27\,ns/reference at 2.305\us . The orange band is the measured minor-fault cost. The inset zooms the CLOCK/S3-FIFO crossing}{figure.caption.22}{}}
